{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-monitoring","title":"Agent 监控与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/agent-monitoring","wordCount":1066,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"agent-监控与可观测性\">Agent 监控与可观测性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Agent 监控是保障 AI 应用质量和可靠性的基础设施。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与传统监控的差异\">与传统监控的差异</h3><ul>\n<li>与传统 Web 服务监控不同，Agent 系统的监控需要覆盖 LLM 推理过程、工具调用链路、成本消耗和输出质量四个维度</li>\n<li>可观测性的目标是让开发者能够回答「Agent 为什么做了这个决定」和「这个决定的结果是否符合预期」</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[追踪 Tracing]--&gt;D[Agent 行为分析]&#10;    B[指标 Metrics]--&gt;D&#10;    C[日志 Logging]--&gt;D&#10;    D--&gt;E[告警系统]&#10;    D--&gt;F[质量看板]&#10;    D--&gt;G[成本分析]\">flowchart TD\n    A[追踪 Tracing]--&gt;D[Agent 行为分析]\n    B[指标 Metrics]--&gt;D\n    C[日志 Logging]--&gt;D\n    D--&gt;E[告警系统]\n    D--&gt;F[质量看板]\n    D--&gt;G[成本分析]</pre><h3 id=\"六个监控维度\">六个监控维度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控维度</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n<th>告警阈值示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>P50/P95/P99 响应时间</td>\n<td>追踪系统</td>\n<td>P95 &gt; 30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>Token 消耗/美元成本</td>\n<td>API 回调</td>\n<td>单次 &gt; $0.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>输出评分/用户反馈</td>\n<td>评估管道</td>\n<td>平均 &lt; 3.5/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性</td>\n<td>成功率/重试率/降级率</td>\n<td>错误追踪</td>\n<td>成功率 &lt; 95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具健康</td>\n<td>调用成功率/延迟</td>\n<td>工具中间件</td>\n<td>失败率 &gt; 10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>异常输入/输出检测</td>\n<td>内容过滤器</td>\n<td>检测到注入尝试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"langsmith-追踪集成\">LangSmith 追踪集成</h2><p>LangSmith 是 LangChain 官方的可观测性平台：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>提供了对 Agent 执行过程的完整追踪能力</li>\n<li>每次 Agent 运行都会生成一棵追踪树，展示从输入到输出的每个步骤</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"两个接入点\">两个接入点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>wrapOpenAI</code></td>\n<td>包装模型客户端，自动上报调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>traceable</code></td>\n<td>包装任意函数为追踪节点，可嵌套</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"接入示例\">接入示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const tracedModel = wrapOpenAI(model);&#10;const pipeline = traceable(&#10;  async (input: string) =&gt; {&#10;    const a = await analyzeDoc(input);&#10;    return report(a);&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;document_pipeline&#39;,&#10;    tags: [&#39;production&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tracedModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapOpenAI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> traceable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeDoc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'document_pipeline'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tags: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>嵌套的 <code>traceable</code> 函数（如 <code>analyzeDoc</code> 自身也被包装）会在追踪树中形成父子节点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"因果链可视化\">因果链可视化</h3><p>LangSmith 追踪的核心价值在于<strong>因果链可视化</strong>——当 Agent 输出不符合预期时，可以在追踪树中定位问题步骤：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可定位的问题</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>prompt 不当</td>\n<td>某节点输入提示有缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具返回异常</td>\n<td>工具节点输出不符合预期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理逻辑偏差</td>\n<td>中间推理步骤偏离任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自定义指标收集\">自定义指标收集</h2><ul>\n<li>生产环境通常需要将 Agent 指标集成到现有的监控基础设施中</li>\n<li>通过 LangChain 的回调机制可以实现自定义指标采集</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"回调钩子与采集点\">回调钩子与采集点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回调钩子</th>\n<th>采集内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>handleLLMStart</code></td>\n<td>记录开始时间、累计调用次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>handleLLMEnd</code></td>\n<td>计算延迟、累计 Token 与成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>handleLLMError</code></td>\n<td>错误计数（用于错误率）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>handleToolStart</code>/<code>handleToolEnd</code></td>\n<td>各工具调用次数与耗时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实现骨架\">实现骨架</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class MetricsCollector extends BaseCallbackHandler {&#10;  async handleLLMEnd(output, runId: string) {&#10;    this.latencies.push(Date.now() - this.startTimes.get(runId));&#10;    const tokens = output.llmOutput?.tokenUsage?.totalTokens ?? 0;&#10;    this.metrics.totalTokens += tokens;&#10;    this.metrics.totalCost += tokens * 0.00003;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MetricsCollector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BaseCallbackHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleLLMEnd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">runId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.latencies.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.startTimes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(runId));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output.llmOutput?.tokenUsage?.totalTokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.metrics.totalTokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokens;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.metrics.totalCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.00003</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"轻量级原则\">轻量级原则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不增延迟</td>\n<td>采集操作不应该影响 Agent 的响应延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量上报</td>\n<td>高频指标在内存中聚合后定期批量发送到监控后端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"评估管道\">评估管道</h2><ul>\n<li>Agent 输出质量的评估需要系统化的方法</li>\n<li>评估管道结合自动化指标和人工评分，持续监控 Agent 的表现趋势</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"llm-as-judge-评分\">LLM-as-judge 评分</h3><p>让评估模型按四个维度输出 1-5 分的 JSON：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>relevance</code></td>\n<td>回答与问题的相关性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>coherence</code></td>\n<td>表达的连贯性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>factuality</code></td>\n<td>事实准确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>overall</code></td>\n<td>综合评分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"批量回归评估\">批量回归评估</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[测试集]--&gt;B[Agent 逐条回答]&#10;    B--&gt;C[评估模型打分]&#10;    C--&gt;D[按维度求平均]&#10;    D--&gt;E[趋势曲线/回归告警]\">flowchart TD\n    A[测试集]--&gt;B[Agent 逐条回答]\n    B--&gt;C[评估模型打分]\n    C--&gt;D[按维度求平均]\n    D--&gt;E[趋势曲线/回归告警]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"for (const c of testCases) {&#10;  const output = await agent.invoke(c.input);&#10;  const ev = await evaluateOutput(c.input, output, c.expectedOutput);&#10;  results.push({ input: c.input, output, eval: ev });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> testCases) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluateOutput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.input, output, c.expectedOutput);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ input: c.input, output, eval: ev });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>测试集可附带 <code>expectedOutput</code> 作为参考答案</li>\n<li>按维度求平均得到趋势曲线，用于发现质量回归</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"告警与异常检测\">告警与异常检测</h2><p>Agent 系统的告警需要覆盖性能退化、成本异常和安全风险三个层面。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则化告警\">规则化告警</h3><p>每条规则由 <code>name</code> + <code>condition</code> 判定函数 + <code>severity</code> 组成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>high_error_rate</code></td>\n<td><code>errorRate &gt; 0.1</code></td>\n<td><code>critical</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>high_latency</code></td>\n<td><code>avgLatency &gt; 30000</code></td>\n<td><code>warning</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cost_spike</code></td>\n<td><code>totalCost &gt; 10</code></td>\n<td><code>warning</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const fired = rules.filter((r) =&gt; r.condition(metrics)).map(toAlertEvent);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fired</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(metrics)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(toAlertEvent);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分级策略\">分级策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发示例</th>\n<th>响应方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>critical</code></td>\n<td>错误率 &gt; 10%</td>\n<td>立即通知值班</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>warning</code></td>\n<td>平均延迟 &gt; 30s、成本超限</td>\n<td>工作时间处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>info</code></td>\n<td>一般性波动</td>\n<td>仅记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li>告警消息应携带具体数值与阈值（如「错误率 12.3% 超过阈值 10%」）</li>\n<li>便于快速判断严重程度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Agent 可观测性需要覆盖追踪、指标和日志三个支柱，重点关注推理链路和工具调用</li>\n<li>LangSmith 提供因果链可视化，是定位 Agent 行为异常的最有效工具</li>\n<li>自定义指标收集应轻量级实现，在内存中聚合后批量发送到监控后端</li>\n<li>评估管道结合自动化评分和人工反馈，持续监控 Agent 输出质量趋势</li>\n<li>告警覆盖性能退化、成本异常和安全风险三个层面，使用分级策略避免告警疲劳</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Agent 监控与可观测性","id":"agent-监控与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"与传统监控的差异","id":"与传统监控的差异"},{"level":3,"text":"六个监控维度","id":"六个监控维度"},{"level":2,"text":"LangSmith 追踪集成","id":"langsmith-追踪集成"},{"level":3,"text":"两个接入点","id":"两个接入点"},{"level":3,"text":"接入示例","id":"接入示例"},{"level":3,"text":"因果链可视化","id":"因果链可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义指标收集","id":"自定义指标收集"},{"level":3,"text":"回调钩子与采集点","id":"回调钩子与采集点"},{"level":3,"text":"实现骨架","id":"实现骨架"},{"level":3,"text":"轻量级原则","id":"轻量级原则"},{"level":2,"text":"评估管道","id":"评估管道"},{"level":3,"text":"LLM-as-judge 评分","id":"llm-as-judge-评分"},{"level":3,"text":"批量回归评估","id":"批量回归评估"},{"level":2,"text":"告警与异常检测","id":"告警与异常检测"},{"level":3,"text":"规则化告警","id":"规则化告警"},{"level":3,"text":"分级策略","id":"分级策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自定义工具开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/custom-tools"},"next":{"title":"Agent 扩展与性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/scaling-agents"}}